OL,3,GNEWSAGatwick passenger's car 'burnt to
OL,4,Aa shell' in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose car was "burnt to a
OL,7,Fshell" in a fire at a parking site for
OL,8,FGatwick Airport holidaymakers says
OL,9,Ftrying to find out what happened has
OL,10,Fbeen "very stressful".
OL,12,FPenny Reardon flew home from the south
OL,13,Fof Spain to find that her Mercedes had
OL,14,Fbeen destroyed in a blaze which damaged
OL,15,F140 vehicles, many of which belonged to
OL,16,Fairport passengers using a third-party
OL,17,Fparking service.
OL,19,FOne person has been arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of arson in relation to the
OL,21,Fincident in Wallage Lane, Rowfant, and
OL,22,Fhas been released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
