OL,3,GNEWSAGatwick passenger's car 'burnt to
OL,4,Aa shell' in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPenny, from Rochester in Kent, said:
OL,7,F"It's very stressful. I had a wonderful
OL,8,Fholiday but now I wish I hadn't gone."
